Nanny Hints by Noble           NannyMUD Times                         Page 9

Presto Chango make your inventory easier to read or a room neater to look at.
'toggle pluralize' is a great way to look at Nanny thanks to Gabes' hard work.
In Rose and Dragon Pub for instance you will see:

Three empty bottles. 

...instead of...

An empty bottle.
An empty bottle.
An empty bottle.

Much neater and less spammy.

Also colour can make your inventory or a room look more informative.
'help colour' will get you started...

I coloured armour, weapons and containers different colours and it makes it
easy to see what is in a room or in your inventory.  Now when I do inventory 
I see 7 underlined cyan coloured longswords, making inventory less confusing.
For instance the weapons I am carrying or that are in a room are underlined
cyan.  I was surprised when traveling after making this change to see how 
many things in Nanny that can be used as weapons.

My favorite friends are different colours and tells as well.  My hpinfo is
bright red to remind me of the times I've died not noticing my state of 
health. Using Nanny help files has made playing here more fun for me and 
maybe now some of you will see Nanny differently too.
